---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="FAQ">
  <h1>Frequently asked questions</h1>
  <p>Answers about plans, billing, collaboration, and getting started with Northstar.</p>
  <h2>How much does Starter cost?</h2>
  <p>Starter costs $29.90 per month, billed monthly in USD.</p>
  <h2>Can I invite teammates?</h2>
  <p>Yes. Starter supports up to three members, while Growth supports up to fifteen.</p>
  <h2>Can I cancel my subscription?</h2>
  <p>You can request cancellation before your next renewal date. See your billing terms for the details applicable to your account.</p>
  <h2>Do you offer onboarding support?</h2>
  <p>Our <a href="/services">services team</a> can help you organize workflows and improve how customers discover your business.</p>
  <h2>Where can I compare plans?</h2>
  <p>See the full <a href="/pricing">pricing comparison</a>.</p>
</Base>
